  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border: 2px solid #FF6600; border-left: 12px solid #FF6600; margin: -1px 10% 0px; background-color: #fff7f2; vertical-align: middle;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 2px 0 2px 0.5em\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4b/Under_contruction_icon-red.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205233522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Under contruction icon-red\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4b/Under_contruction_icon-red.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20171205233522\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Under contruction icon-red.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_contruction_icon-red.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0.25em 0.5em; width: 100%;\"><b>The following  page is under construction</b>.\n<p>Please do not edit or alter this article in any way while this template is active. All unauthorized edits may be reverted on the admin's discretion. Propose any changes to the comment section.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width: 315px; border-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 90%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">American Troubles\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"infobox\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin: 0; cellpadding: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Date\n</th>\n<td>2021 - 2028\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Location\n</th>\n<td>United States of America, (with spillovers into Mexico and Canada)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Causes\n</th>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Result\n</th>\n<td>Inconclusive\n<ul><li>Start of the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Tide\" title=\"White Tide\">White Tide</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Belligerents\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c2/US_flag_51stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055222\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 51stars\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c2/US_flag_51stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055222\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 51stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_51stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\">United States Federal Government:</a></b>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><b>Far right militants:</b><br />\nPatriot front<br />\nLeague of the South<br />\nOath Keepers<br />\nProud Boys<br />\nAtomwaffen Division<br />\nRebel police units\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Commanders\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c2/US_flag_51stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055222\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 51stars\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/c/c2/US_flag_51stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055222\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 51stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_51stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States_(The_Second_Renaissance)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"President of the United States (The Second Renaissance)\">Kamala Harris</a><br />\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><br />\n<br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Strength\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">1.7 million\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Casualties and losses\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">5,400\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">197\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>The American Troubles</b>&#160;was a&#160;period of domestic terrorism and vigilantism during the 2020s. It is sometimes described as a \"guerrilla war\" or a \"low-level war\". The conflict began with the Trump Insurrection on the US Capitol on January 6th, 2021.\n</p><p>&#160;\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081542\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 331/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6110/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2978/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion de